"Taltos, meddling with the rewrite for sport, reshaped a few survivors' bodies at random; hers is one."
"Her body is wholly hers now, healthy and whole, and grows with the System like any other."
"The System knows her as Nala, the name she holds for herself, and says so wherever it names her."
"Her walled-off memories hold the culling night and her run through a portal in her own house."
